    "title": "Gilbert Fire & Rescue to host holiday event Dec. 6 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "18 hours ago\nGilbert Fire & Rescue will host a Ride on a Fire Truck and Photos with Santa holiday event from 9-11 a.m. Dec. 6 at Walmart, 2501 S. Market St., Gilbert.\nThe event will feature rides on a fire truck, photos with Santa and an appearance by the Grinch. Attendees are encouraged to bring a new, unwrapped toy or gift card to donate.\nAll donations will go to Gilbert Public Schools to support children in need during the holiday season.\nRegistration is encouraged but not required. Those who would like more information or to sign up can visit the event page .",
